{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54587","headline":"兵要望江南 占霞第六（京本列第二十六○十一首） 七 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占霞第六（京本列第二十六○十一首） 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城营上，五色气幷霞。\n尽是贼（京本作「败」）军天预显，早须爲计好防他（辛本、川本作「警觉较量些」、京本作「警悟较些些」）。\n否则死如麻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54587.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54587","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}